Implemented and verified the HumanEval task with a custom K semantics.

- Entry point and helper: [solution.py](/work/solution.py)
- Generated translation: [solution.mpy](/work/solution.mpy)
- Semantics: [semantic.k](/work/semantic.k)
- Verification model: [verification.k](/work/verification.k)
- Universal proof claims: [spec.k](/work/spec.k)
- Reproducible commands: [prove.sh](/work/prove.sh)

`./prove.sh` passed all Python checks, four `krun` executions, and all seven proof claims. `kprove` printed `#Top` and exited 0.

